This Repository can be found here: https://github.com/pbigalke/data-investigation.git
It contains a number of scripts to read and plot different data sources, as well as some preprocessing methods and 
some investigations of specific datasets.

**/config**
This folder contains some info files on e.g. extent of different domains or specific folders that are recurring in the investigation.

**/crop_over_hail**
In this folder, you can find a plotting script for visualising the different procedures to crop MSG data over hail areas 
or PMW satellite overpasses. The script crop_over_hail_or_overpass.py describes the methods to create the crop over the specific location.

**/examine_PMW_file_content**
This folder holds a number of scripts to investigate the file content of the MWCCH data from the PMW overpasses. 
The occurences of different hail class and overpass areas are investigated. The scripts called "MWCC-H-regridded....py" 
contain the plots created after preprocessing the MWCCH data and regrid them to MSG. The scripts called "MWCC-H_overview...py"
contain old plots from when the data was not yet processed.

**/helpers**
Contains helper functions for handling and converting datetimes and collecting matching files from different data sources.

**/plot_different_datasources**
Contains plotting scripts for different datasets. The functions will loop over certain data and plot them using the 
methods defined in /plotting_helpers. Some functions are not yet commented.

**/plotting_helpers**
Contains raw plotting functions for different data. These are used in /plot_different_datasources. Some functions are not yet commented.

**/preprocess_data**
Contains scripts to preprocess the MWCC-H hail probability and the Brightness Temperatures from SSMIS.

**/readers**
Contains scripts to read in different data sources and extract useful information.
